37
00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:44.870
Rough, Rough, Rough! Smooth, Smooth, Smooth! Sharp, Sharp, Sharp! Blunt, Blunt, Blunt!

38
00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:51.659
Loose, Loose, Loose! Tight, Tight, Tight! Deep, Deep, Deep! Shallow, Shallow, Shallow!

39
00:01:51.959 --> 00:01:54.704
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:01:55.717 --> 00:02:10.405
Malis touches things with her fingers. The rock is rough, but the glass is smooth. The knife is sharp, so she does not touch it! Her old shoes are loose, but her new shoes are tight. The pool is shallow at one end and deep at the other.

41
00:02:10.705 --> 00:02:12.971
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:13.983 --> 00:02:16.833
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:22.060
Smooth! Well done!

44
00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:25.517
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:30.175
Rough! Well done!

46
00:02:31.183 --> 00:02:33.476
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:36.376 --> 00:02:38.215
Shallow! Well done!

48
00:02:39.217 --> 00:02:40.891
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:41.191 --> 00:02:44.633
The rock feels rough. My shoes are too tight.

50
00:02:45.433 --> 00:02:46.422
Your turn!

51
00:02:49.922 --> 00:02:53.701
The rock feels rough. My shoes are too tight.

52
00:02:54.717 --> 00:02:56.821
